{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:75d7af017a7eaa76","name":"Ixiyen-Class Fast Attack Craft","source":{"id":"source:reference-75d7af017a7eaa76","title":"Ixiyen-Class Fast Attack Craft","revision":20680,"timestamp":"2024-08-26T00:18:14Z","sha256":"7783839d082a4e655be1106f6bd176f485bd8149fca2278466d839df23fd6818","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=20680","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Ixiyen-Class%20Fast%20Attack%20Craft&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-75d7af017a7eaa76","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Rebellion Era Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Rebellion_Era_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Built by TransGalMeg Industries throughout the Galactic Civil War, the ",{"tag":"i","children":["Ixiyen"]},"-Class Fighter is sold to numerous independent groups, and fighters often change hands multiple times. TransGalMeg Industries is officially allied with the Empire but located in ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Mid Rim"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Mid_Rim?action=edit&redlink=1"},", where populations are sparse and Imperial inspections are rare. Thus, the corporation feels safe in selling small numbers of the Starfighters to anyone who has the credits to pay. As long as the vessels don't flood the market and TransGalMeg keeps the Empire supplied, Imperial officials overlook the corporation's side sales. The fighters are popular as squadron leader vessels and bounty hunter ships. Still, TransGalMeg does not produce the ",{"tag":"i","children":["Ixiyen"]},"-Class extensively, and no single group amasses the vessel in large numbers.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Though the Fast Attack Craft is specifically designed to oppose ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starfighters"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starfighters","referenceId":"reference:e127af2636e147fc"},", its weapons can pose a threat to larger ships as well. With its heavy armor and shields, the ",{"tag":"i","children":["Ixiyen"]},"-Class Fighter can overwhelm smaller ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starships"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starships"}," with brutal frontal assaults, shrugging off enemy counterattacks. However, its basic frame is not particularly sturdy, and the ship lacks the staying power and payload necessary for prolonged conflicts. Its main drawback is its lack of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid"}," or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Gunner"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Gunner","referenceId":"reference:0cbc0bc5729f801f"}," slots, forcing the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle Pilot"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle_Pilot","referenceId":"reference:4aff6d0e54fff36e"}," to choose between ",{"tag":"a","children":["Weapon Systems"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Weapon_Systems"}," for each attack. Expert pilots often use ",{"tag":"a","children":["Concussion Missiles"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Concussion_Missiles","referenceId":"reference:c95ee0f6eb24f16e"}," to devastating effect before resorting to laser fire, but in anything longer than a short dogfight, more versatile ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starfighters"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starfighters","referenceId":"reference:e127af2636e147fc"}," have an edge.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Default (Normal)"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Ixiyen"]},"-Class Fast Attack Craft Statistics (CL 8)"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Gargantuan ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starfighter"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starfighter"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Initiative"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Initiative","referenceId":"reference:3e687de48a6ad4e5"},":"]}," +3; ",{"tag":"b","children":["Senses:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Perception"],"href":"